    "sentence_translations": [
      "Holding Up an Umbrella",
      "",
      "Little Ming is very fond of a girl from the class next door, but has not dared to speak to her yet.",
      "One day, the teacher had the girl run as a punishment for being late to class.",
      "She ran and ran, and it began to rain.",
      "Little Ming took an umbrella, ran up next to the girl and started to run together with her.",
      "The girl blushed and said embarrassedly: “I'm sorry, I have a boyfriend...”",
      "Little Ming pondered for a bit, then said his first words to the girl:",
      "“Do you want this umbrella? It's 10 yuan...”"
    ]
